1
00:00:04,194 --> 00:00:07,654
Oh, yeah. This door got the full monty.

2
00:00:08,073 --> 00:00:09,323
PENNY: Leonard?
- Uh-huh?

3
00:00:09,491 --> 00:00:11,371
(Penny:)What the hell?

4
00:00:11,743 --> 00:00:15,663
- A killer robot. We built it.
- Yeah, well, it almost killed me.

5
00:00:15,831 --> 00:00:19,421
(Sheldon:)If it wanted to kill you, you'd be dead.

6
00:00:22,754 --> 00:00:25,044
So who exactly does it wanna kill?

7
00:00:25,549 --> 00:00:28,339
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry, are you unaware
of the upcoming...

8
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:32,600
(Sheldon:)...Southern California Robot
Fighting League Round Robin Invitational?

9
00:00:33,807 --> 00:00:37,517
(Penny:)You know, since I moved last year,
not all my mail has been forwarded.

10
00:00:39,646 --> 00:00:41,026
It's a big deal, heh.

11
00:00:41,190 --> 00:00:44,780
(Howard:)There's an awards banquet
and a dance afterward.

12
00:00:45,235 --> 00:00:48,525
(Howard:)Perhaps you'd like to come with me.

13
00:00:49,364 --> 00:00:53,284
(Howard:)I know the other fellas
would be really excited to see a girl there.

14
00:00:53,952 --> 00:00:56,162
(Penny:)How is it supposed to be a dance
if I'm the only girl?

15
00:00:56,330 --> 00:00:58,960
(Howard:)Well, that may be a slight exaggeration.

16
00:00:59,124 --> 00:01:04,024
(Howard:)You'd be the only doable girl.

